    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 03RD OCTOBER 2026 - 11.45AM TO 12.15PM\n\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present Number 6 Ridgewood Square to the market. Ideally positioned within the ever-popular Ridgewood development, this attractive end terrace home offers well-proportioned accommodation, a private rear garden and a particularly pleasant outlook over a large green area to the front.\n\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and is ready for its new owners to move straight in. With vacant possession and immediate availability, it is likely to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Upon arrival, a welcoming hallway provides access to the guest Wc and leads through to the bright front facing living room. To the rear, the kitchen and dining area enjoys a lovely connection with the garden, creating a practical and sociable space for both day to day living and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from generous built-in storage. The main bathroom is conveniently accessed from both the landing and the principal bedroom, offering added practicality and privacy.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a fully paved and private rear patio, providing an ideal low-maintenance outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. There is also access to a communal green space from the patio. The front of the property overlooks an extensive communal green area, giving the home an open and attractive aspect along with on-street parking available to the front.\n\nNumber 6 Ridgewood Square represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located home in a mature and popular development, with local amenities, transport links and Swords town centre all within easy reach.\n\nIdeally situated in the heart of Ridgewood, the property enjoys close proximity to an abundance of local amenities including shops, schools, parks, sports clubs and regular public transport services. Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways, Airside Retail Park, Pavilions Shopping Centre and Swords Village are all easily accessible, making this a highly convenient location for modern family living.\n\nThis outstanding family home combines spacious accommodation, excellent presentation and a prime location, making it a property that must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\n*Furnished Images presented are staged using AI*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 0.9m x 0.8m\nTiled flooring. Access to guest Wc.\n\nGuest Wc - 0.8m x 1.5m\nWc and wash hand basin. Tiled flooring.\n\nLounge - 5.80m x 4.0m\nBright and spacious lounge with open fireplace and timber surround. Laminate wood flooring.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.0m x 3.5m\nWell-appointed kitchen with ample range of wall and floor units, worktops, tiled splashback, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Tiled flooring. French doors lead to the rear courtyard.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 3.4m x 1.9m\nAccess to attic and hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.2m\nLarge double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, and access to the main bathroom.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 3.1m\nDouble bedroom with laminate wood flooring and built-in wardrobes overlooking the rear.\n\nBathroom - 3.9m x 1.9m\nComprising bath, Wc, and wash hand basin. Fully tiled walls and floor\n\n"
